@startuml 14-error-handling
title Error mapping: RestExceptionHandler (ADR-004); client-facing messages in Polish

skinparam shadowing false

start
:exception leaves a controller;
switch (type)
case (BadRequestException)
  :400 with its Polish message
  (e.g. comparison of different Cases, demo cadence off);
case (@Valid failure, missing or mistyped field)
  :400 "Popraw błędy w formularzu."
  errors: [{field, message}];
case (NotFoundException)
  :404 (unknown Case or Analysis);
case (ConflictException)
  :409 (Analysis already running, report of a running Analysis,
  comparison with a running Analysis);
case (ValidationException)
  :422;
case (DuplicateKeyException)
  :409 with a fixed Polish message;
case (Spring MVC error: unknown route, wrong method, malformed body)
  :standard status with a fixed Polish message;
case (anything else)
  :500 reason phrase only, logged with stack trace;
endswitch
:ErrorResponse(code, message, errors?);
note right
  Services log WARN where they throw a 4xx exception;
  the handler logs only unexpected 5xx errors.
  Analysis stage failures never reach HTTP: the orchestrator
  stores them as FAILED or PARTIAL with fixed failure codes.
end note
stop
@enduml
